    <body>
        <segment id="1" parent="19" relname="antithesis">We can go on and on quoting the dictionary for the true meaning of intuitiveness.</segment>
        <segment id="2" parent="21" relname="circumstance">However, when it comes to software and web interface,</segment>
        <segment id="3" parent="21" relname="span">it is just another catchy term that makes the product more attractive to those who dont know much about software/Web interfaces.</segment>
        <segment id="4" parent="3" relname="elaboration">Add the warranty, and it would probably cost more.</segment>
        <segment id="5" parent="20" relname="disjunction">The term intuitiveness shouldnt be use to describe how easy it may be to learn a new software or website interface.</segment>
        <segment id="6" parent="20" relname="disjunction">Nor should it be used to sell more products.</segment>
        <segment id="7" parent="8" relname="preparation">Take for example my parents, who are not technically inclined.</segment>
        <segment id="8" parent="17" relname="span">If they are using a product that seems easy to them,</segment>
        <segment id="9" parent="16" relname="contrast">to me it could be quite the opposite.</segment>
        <segment id="10" parent="18" relname="contrast">On the other hand, if I am working with a product that seems easy to me,</segment>
        <segment id="11" parent="18" relname="contrast">it may seem difficult to them.</segment>
        <segment id="12" parent="15" relname="summary">I believe that it is all relative to what the user feels about the product at the time it is being used.</segment>
        <group id="13" type="span"/>
        <group id="14" type="span" parent="13" relname="span"/>
        <group id="15" type="multinuc" parent="23" relname="span"/>
        <group id="16" type="multinuc" parent="15" relname="contrast"/>
        <group id="17" type="span" parent="16" relname="contrast"/>
        <group id="18" type="multinuc" parent="15" relname="contrast"/>
        <group id="19" type="span" parent="14" relname="span"/>
        <group id="20" type="multinuc" parent="22" relname="elaboration"/>
        <group id="21" type="span" parent="22" relname="span"/>
        <group id="22" type="span" parent="19" relname="span"/>
        <group id="23" type="span" parent="14" relname="evidence"/>
    </body>
